Error [E1003]: `300` doesn't fit in `U8`, which holds 0..255
  --> tests/ui/overflow_word_literal_out_of_range.jet:2:23
    |
  2 |     print(wrapping(U8{300}))
    |                       ^^^
 Why: `wrapping` decides what a value that doesn't fit becomes, but a written literal is known now, so it must fit
 Fix: Write `U8{44}`, which is what `wrapping` gives for 300
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1003
